@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SimSun
skinparam defaultFontSize 17
skinparam dpi 200
skinparam ArrowColor black
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor white
skinparam NoteBorderColor black
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor white
skinparam BoundaryBackgroundColor white
skinparam ControlBackgroundColor white
hide footbox
skinparam maxMessageSize 200
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam sequence {
 ParticipantBackgroundColor white
 ParticipantBorderColor black
 LifeLineBorderColor black
 LifeLineBackgroundColor white
 ArrowColor black
 GroupBackgroundColor white
 GroupBorderColor black
}
actor "牙医" as A0
boundary "<u>:牙医接口</u>" as B0
control "<u>:提出复诊随访要</u>\n<u>求控制</u>" as K
participant "<u>:就诊</u>" as Visit
participant "<u>:治疗方案</u>" as Plan
participant "<u>:方案版本</u>" as PlanVersion
participant "<u>:诊后要求</u>" as Followup
A0 -> B0 : 提交UC-12办理依据
activate B0
B0 -> B0 : 检查输入格式()
B0 -> K : 协调UC-12办理(对象、依据)
activate K
critical 本阶段关联结果共同生效
opt 要求来源包含就诊
K -> Visit : 提供诊后来源(患者、签署依据或草稿)
activate Visit
Visit --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Visit
end
opt 要求来源包含持续方案
K -> Plan : 提供诊后方案依据(持续方案或空)
activate Plan
Plan -> PlanVersion : 提供确认来源(具体版本)
activate PlanVersion
PlanVersion --> Plan : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate PlanVersion
Plan --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Plan
end
K -> Followup : 提出诊后要求(有效来源、目的、目标日期、责\n任人)
activate Followup
Followup -> Followup : 判断发布条件(来源已签署或已确认)
Followup --> K : 处理结果或拒绝原因
deactivate Followup
end
K --> B0 : 本阶段结果及下一步依据
deactivate K
B0 --> A0 : 展示结果、状态和原因
deactivate B0
note over K,Followup
校验不通过时返回规约中的原因；
本阶段不留下部分有效结果。
end note

@enduml
